<<SetCharacterExpression "Ramu" "Excited">>
Ramu: Finals evening. But a small one.

<<SetCharacterExpression "Raju" "Excited">>
Raju: Feels like practice.

<<SetCharacterExpression "Ramu" "Excited">>
Ramu: It is practice. Everything is practice until it isn't. This tournament is just March staying busy.

<<SetCharacterExpression "Raju" "Excited">>
Raju: Any prize?

<<SetCharacterExpression "Ramu" "Excited">>
Ramu: Couple hundred rupees maybe. Tea money. The real tournament comes later this month.

<<SetCharacterExpression "Raju" "Curious">>
Raju: Then why try hard?

<<SetCharacterExpression "Ramu" "Serious">>
Ramu: Because we don't know how to try soft. We play our way, every day. Ready?

<<SetCharacterExpression "Raju" "Determined">>
Raju: Ready.

